WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a standing forward fold, shift your weight into the right foot.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Frame the standing foot with your hands (or blocks) and steady the base.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lift the left leg up behind you, reaching through the heel.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Draw the crown of the head toward the floor as the top leg rises.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep hips level over the standing foot, hold, then switch sides.
